OL,4,CRAF's next fighter jet could be last   
OL,5,Ccrewed combat plane, air chief says    
OL,6,GBritain's next-generation fighter jet  
OL,7,Gcould be the last crewed combat        
OL,8,Gaircraft the UK builds, the head of    
OL,9,Gthe RAF has said.                      
OL,11,FAir Chief Marshal Sir Harv Smyth, said 
OL,12,FArtificial Intelligence (AI) enabled,  
OL,13,Funcrewed aircraft would "transform     
OL,14,Fmilitary aviation".                    
OL,16,FHis comments refer to the Global       
OL,17,FCombat Air Programme (GCAP), a         
OL,18,Fpartnership between the UK, Italy and  
OL,19,FJapan to develop a sixth-generation    
OL,20,Ffighter jet, expected to enter service 
OL,21,Fby 2035.                               
